# tally 2.2.1 P35 (L §8.2 l.2248, "an entry is listed under a result exactly when a read in its set gave it", whatever
# the form of the line, its outcome, or the way a movement came not to count): B2, "a read of facts stated same holds both sides' reads": sp
# lists the pin that removes the hole, sq the pin the hole quotes (review g2 min/b2). Before W8: no line.
=== b2.tally
model b2
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input a1: money PLN
input a2: money PLN
input d: date
move in1: transfers
  on d
  leg cash from world to konto amount a1
move in2: transfers
  on d
  leg cash from world to konto amount a2
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  a1 = 100.00 PLN "s"
  a2 = 120.00 PLN "s"
  d = 2026-03-05 "s"
  same in1 = in2
ask s0: sum(m.cash.amount for m in transfers over 2026-03)
ask sp: sum(m.cash.amount for m in transfers over 2026-03) with a2 = 100.00 PLN
ask sq: sum(m.cash.amount for m in transfers over 2026-03) with a2 = 130.00 PLN
ask bp: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with a2 = 100.00 PLN
ask f1: flows(in1, 2026-03)
ask f2: flows(in2, 2026-03)
=== expect sp sq bp
sp: 100.00 PLN
  pinned: a2 = 100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
sq: ?"in1 and in2 are one, but leg cash differs on 2026-03-05: 100.00 PLN (in1) and 130.00 PLN (in2)" (in1, in2)
  pinned: a2 = 130.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
bp: 600.00 PLN
  pinned: a2 = 100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
